exports[`L7 — Deterministic Terminal Snapshots > Snapshot: Screen 7 — Partial Review Report 1`] = `
"Consolidated Review Report (Run: run-20261016-demo42):                           Format: [SUMMARY]

 ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │                                                                                                │
 │ PARTIAL REVIEW: Incomplete specialist coverage (Quality lane failed).                          │
 │                                                                                                │
 └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

 Verified Findings (4 total — use [↑/↓] to inspect):

 ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                                                │
 │ ▶ [P1] Null input is dereferenced in token resolver                                            │
 │                                                                                                │
 │     Path: src/demo.ts:17 | Specialists: logic                                                  │
 │     Evidence: parseToken(header) can return null when header is absent, but token.sub is       │
 │     dereferenced without guard.                                                                │
 │     Impact: Unauthenticated or malformed requests will trigger unhandled TypeError 500         │
 │     crashes.                                                                                   │
 │     Recommendation: Add early null check: \`if (!token) return [];\` before accessing            │
 │     \`token.sub\`.                                                                               │
 │                                                                                                │
 │   [P1] Insecure fallback key generated when AUTH_SECRET is omitted                             │
 │   [P2] Unbounded in-memory Map leads to potential node memory leak                             │
 │   [P2] Missing connection timeout on Redis client pool initialization                          │
 │                                                                                                │
 ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Controls: Press [M] for Markdown toggle | [J] for JSON toggle

 Press [Enter] to Open Dry-Run Publication Gate  |  Press [Esc] to Return"
`;

